{"product":{"id":8076114165838,"title":"Imagination Alternatives Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover three fragrances inspired by the fresh, luxurious character of Louis Vuitton Imagination in one curated sample set. From creamy citrus and spicy woods to fresh aquatic brightness, this trio offers three distinct interpretations of the popular Imagination-style fragrance profile.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArabiyat Prestige Marwa Eau de Parfum\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A fresh and elegant fragrance with bright citrus, aromatic spices and smooth woody warmth. Clean, refined and versatile.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKarus Blu Spice\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A fresh, spicy fragrance combining citrusy brightness with aromatic and woody nuances. Energetic, modern and easy to wear.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAqua Dubai\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – A vibrant fragrance with fresh citrus, fruity and aquatic touches balanced by warm woods. Crisp, smooth and contemporary.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree fresh and sophisticated creations in one set — a great way to explore Imagination-inspired fragrances and find your favorite before committing to a full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-16T17:14:32+05:30","handle":"imagination-inspired-sample-set-marwa-edp-karus-blu-spice-aqua-dubai-3-1-5ml","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:54:37+05:30","published_at":"2026-09-21T11:13:23+05:30","template_suffix"